      "content": "thanks. but \"taking time\" feels like such a lie. what's the point of rebuilding? i've already spent my best years on a dream that turned out to be a massive mistake. i'm just tired of the effort. i look at the math of it all and it just doesn't add up anymore. it feels like i'm just pouring more energy into a bucket with no bottom. i'm just done with the struggle.",
